var CPL=100,CPq='';function rCustTbl(more){const q=($('#custQ').value||'').toLowerCase();if(q!==CPq){CPL=100;CPq=q}if(more===true)CPL+=200;const CS2=D.c.filter(c=>mt(c.n+' '+(c.ph||''),q));$('#custTbl').innerHTML=`<table class="tbl"><tr><th>العميل</th><th>الهاتف</th><th>سابق</th><th>المشتريات</th><th>المدفوع</th><th>الرصيد</th><th></th></tr>${CS2.slice(0,CPL).map(c=>`<tr><td>${e(c.n)}</td><td>${e(c.ph)}</td><td>${f(c.prev)}</td><td>${f(c.bought)}</td><td>${f(c.paid)}</td><td><b class="${cbal(c)>0?'text-rose-600':'text-emerald-700'}">${f(cbal(c))}</b></td><td class="whitespace-nowrap"><button class="bt" onclick="cp('${c.id}')">دفعة</button> <button class="bt flex items-center gap-1 inline-flex" onclick="msgCust('${c.id}')">${ic('message','w-4 h-4')}مراسلة</button> <button class="bt" onclick="cs('${c.id}')">كشف حساب</button> <button class="bt" onclick="ce('${c.id}')">تعديل</button> ${isA()?`<button class="bt bd" onclick="ok('حذف العميل؟',()=>{D.c=D.c.filter(x=>x.id!='${c.id}');save();rCust()})">حذف</button>`:''}</td></tr>`).join('')}</table>${CS2.length>CPL?`<button class="bt bg1 w-full mt-2" onclick="rCustTbl(true)">عرض المزيد (${CS2.length-CPL})</button>`:''}`}
function ce(id,pos){const c0=D.c.find(x=>x.id==id);fm('عميل',[['n','الاسم','text',1],['ph','الهاتف'],['prev','رصيد سابق','number']],c0||{},o=>{if(!o.n)return tz('اكتب اسم العميل');const d={n:o.n,ph:o.ph,prev:+o.prev||0};let nid=id;if(c0)Object.assign(c0,d);else{nid=U();D.c.push({id:nid,...d,bought:0,paid:0,t:Date.now()})}save();if(pos){fillCust();$('#pCust').value=nid;tot()}else rCust()})}
